  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay\" title=\"Nundu Bay\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Nundu Bay (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Nundu Bay\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nundu_Bay.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Nundu Bay.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/41/Nundu_Bay.jpg/196px-Nundu_Bay.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/4/41/Nundu_Bay.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Marga_Coast\" title=\"Marga Coast\">Marga Coast</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Nundu Bay world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg/196px-Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg/294px-Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c0/Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg/392px-Nundu_Bay_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"673\" data-file-height=\"514\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Nundu Bay inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg/196px-Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg/294px-Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/01/Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg/392px-Nundu_Bay_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>A bustling port on the <a href=\"/wiki/Marga_Gulf\" title=\"Marga Gulf\">Marga Gulf</a> used mostly by fishing vessels, Nundu Bay is an idyllic port town in almost every way. Visitors are advised to steer clear of the <a href=\"/wiki/Corsairs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Corsairs\">corsairs</a>, literally.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Nundu Bay</b> is situated along the southwestern shore of <a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>. It is a quiet place frequented mostly by fishermen and <a href=\"/wiki/Corsair\" title=\"Corsair\">corsairs</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Collectors\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Collectors</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Merchants_and_traders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Merchants and traders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Other_services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Ronjok_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Ronjok in Danger</a> will conclude in this outpost. That quest, together with <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_or_Mind:_Garden_in_Danger\" title=\"Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger\">Heart or Mind: Garden in Danger</a>, represents a branch in the Nightfall storyline. While both can be completed, completing just one will make the other one optional.\n</p><p>An early <a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">secondary quest</a> in Marga Coast, <a href=\"/wiki/Herds_to_the_Slaughter\" title=\"Herds to the Slaughter\">Herds to the Slaughter</a>, actually leads to a spot that's very near the entrance to this outpost.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Marga_Coast\" title=\"Marga Coast\">Marga Coast</a> (northeast)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Collectors\">Collectors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Nundu_Bay_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Collectors\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Munashe\" title=\"Munashe\">Munashe</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Collector\" title=\"Collector\">collector</a> for 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Kuskale_Claw\" title=\"Kuskale Claw\">Kuskale Claws</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id